OL,3,GNEWSAViews sought on track next to new
OL,4,Askate park
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are being asked for their
OL,7,Fopinions on adding a pump track next to
OL,8,Fa new skate park which is being created
OL,9,Fin Surrey.
OL,11,FSurrey Heath Borough Council is
OL,12,Fconsidering adding the track, where
OL,13,Fpeople use momentum to get around
OL,14,Finstead of pedalling, alongside the new
OL,15,Fpark at Crabtree Recreation Ground in
OL,16,FCamberley.
OL,18,FIn September, #300,000 was reserved for
OL,19,Fa new pump track with the condition a
OL,20,Fconsultation was carried out.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
